WEBVTT

00:15:00.006 --> 00:15:04.299
it feels to me like this whole project
of, like, wiring up a civilization

00:15:04.323 --> 00:15:07.482
and getting billions of people
to come into contact with each other

00:15:07.506 --> 00:15:08.917
is just impossible.

00:15:10.204 --> 00:15:13.234
But modern cities tell us
that it is possible

00:15:13.258 --> 00:15:15.504
for millions of people
who are really different,

00:15:15.528 --> 00:15:18.409
sometimes living
right on top of each other,

00:15:18.433 --> 00:15:20.107
not just to not kill each other,

00:15:20.131 --> 00:15:22.871
but to actually build things together,

00:15:22.895 --> 00:15:24.228
find new experiences,

00:15:24.252 --> 00:15:27.799
create beautiful,
important infrastructure.

00:15:29.153 --> 00:15:33.034
And we cannot give up on that promise.